-- User-provided source recordings are storage only, independent of live AI calls.
ALTER TABLE policy_versions DROP CONSTRAINT policy_versions_kind_check;
ALTER TABLE policy_versions ADD CONSTRAINT policy_versions_kind_check CHECK(kind IN('privacy_notice','private_story_storage','ai_text_processing','private_photo_storage','private_person_photo_storage','virtual_gift_storage','person_gift_returns','gift_delivery_photo_storage','private_letter_storage','person_letter_replies','person_gather_replies','private_chat_photo_storage','person_chat_image_replies','person_world_actions','person_story_branches','person_offline_life','production_model_execution','person_voice_calls','private_person_voice_storage'));
ALTER TABLE consent_events DROP CONSTRAINT consent_events_purpose_check;
ALTER TABLE consent_events ADD CONSTRAINT consent_events_purpose_check CHECK(purpose IN('privacy_notice','private_story_storage','ai_text_processing','private_photo_storage','private_person_photo_storage','virtual_gift_storage','person_gift_returns','gift_delivery_photo_storage','private_letter_storage','person_letter_replies','person_gather_replies','private_chat_photo_storage','person_chat_image_replies','person_world_actions','person_story_branches','person_offline_life','production_model_execution','person_voice_calls','private_person_voice_storage'));
INSERT INTO policy_versions(id,kind,version,document_zh_cn,document_en) VALUES
('93071867-af3c-4667-bdea-4c9783f51c28','private_person_voice_storage',1,
'西界人物原声音样本保存授权
你可以明确录制或选择你有权使用的真实声音，保存为当前人物的一份私人声音样本。每份原文件最多8 MiB，实际音频最多30秒；服务验证真实音轨并转为单声道24 kHz PCM WAV以便播放，按真实解码结果记录时长，不补造示例声音或成功状态。原上传仅作验证与重试，验证后清理；规范化声音保存在私有对象存储。
本用途仅保存和播放你提交的声音，不发送给AI、不用于声线克隆、模仿、实时AI通话、长期记忆或后续文字上下文。另行选择的语气、音色偏好不改写原样本。文字、照片和实时AI通话各自有独立授权。
普通保存和播放同时需要当前私人文字资料保存授权、本授权及仍有效的同账号人物。读取凭据绑定会话与当前授权版本，不能公开分享；替换、删除人物或注销使旧绑定失效。你可以单独撤回声音授权；撤回停止新的保存、未完成任务发布和播放，重新允许不会恢复旧读取凭据或旧任务。已存样本不因撤回自动假称已删除，仍可在不重授本用途的情况下导出、解绑或删除；账号注销清理声音原文件、规范化文件、任务、绑定及相应记录，保留必要删除围栏。',
'Xijie original character voice sample storage permission
Explicitly record or select real audio you have the right to use as one private sample for the current character. Each input is at most8MiB and actual audio at most30seconds. The service verifies a real audio track and converts it to mono24kHz PCM WAV for playback, recording decoded duration without fabricating sample audio or success. Uploaded source bytes support validation and retry and are then cleaned; canonical audio stays in private object storage.
This purpose only stores and plays user-provided audio. It sends none to AI and provides no cloning, imitation, live AI calls, long-term memory or later text context. Tone and timbre preferences never rewrite the original sample. Text, photos and live AI calls have independent permissions.
Normal storage and playback need current private text storage, this permission and a valid same-account character. Read proofs bind the session and current permission versions and cannot be shared publicly. Replacement, character removal and account erasure invalidate old bindings. Withdrawal stops new saves, unfinished publication and playback; regrant revives no old proof or task. Stored samples are not represented as deleted merely because permission is withdrawn. Export, unbinding and deletion need no renewed voice grant. Account erasure removes raw and canonical bytes, jobs, bindings and related records while retaining necessary erasure fences.');
